    {
      "text": "Figure 8.4(c), the normalised global priority scores from the ANP run — the \"Here are the priorities.\" panel again, listing Goal_Node 0.00000, C1 0.13956, C2 0.34836, C3 0.51208, and, outlined in red, A1 0.56218 and A2 0.43782. The red box marks the two numbers that answer the decision: A1 ranks above A2. The alternatives' two values sum to 1.0000 and the three criteria's to 1.0000 separately, which is the \"normalized by cluster\" the column heading names.",
      "state": "draft",
